{"path":"about.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f6efe6;--card:#fff6f0;--accent:#7a5a3c;--muted:#6b6b6b;--green:#8aa57a}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;color:#2b2b2b;background:var(--bg) url('assets/img/pattern.svg') repeat}
    header{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(122,90,60,0.06),transparent);padding:22px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(122,90,60,0.06)}
    .nav{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}
    .brand{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);font-size:18px}
    nav a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px}
    nav a:hover{background:rgba(122,90,60,0.06)}

    main{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:0 18px}
    .lead{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:20px;align-items:start}
    .panel{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(37,31,25,0.04)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;color:var(--accent)}
    p.lead-copy{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}

    .aside{font-size:14px}
    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:9px;text-decoration:none}

    .features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:20px}
    .feature{padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(138,165,122,0.04),transparent)}
    .feature h3{margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:15px;color:var(--accent)}
    .feature p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    .process{margin-top:22px;display:flex;gap:12px}
    .step{flex:1;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff}
    footer{max-width:980px;margin:36px auto;padding:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* modal */
    .modal-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(15,15,15,0.45);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px}
    .modal{background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;max-width:720px;width:100%;box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(19,14,11,0.25)}
    .modal .controls{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:14px}
    .pulse{width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:999px;border:6px solid rgba(122,90,60,0.12);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:12px auto}
    .pulse .inner{width:68px;height:68px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--green);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    .sr-only{position:absolute;left:-10000px;top:auto;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}

    .disclaimer{margin-top:16px;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff3f0;border-left:4px solid rgba(122,90,60,0.14);font-size:13px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="nav">
      <div class="brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <nav style="margin-left:18px;display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="events.html">Gatherings</a>
        <a href="private-sessions.html">Solo Sessions</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Circle Plans</a>
        <a href="about.html" aria-current="page">About & Practice</a>
        <a href="faq.html">Help</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
      <div style="margin-left:auto">
        <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="lead">
      <div>
        <div class="panel">
          <h1>About the method</h1>
          <p class="lead-copy">Our sessions are an intentional container: warm tones, measured pacing, and simple invitations to restore breath and attention. We combine long-form harmonic textures with guided focal moments so you return to daily life steadier.</p>
          <a class="cta" href="pricing.html" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:12px">Explore Circle Plans</a>

          <div class="features" style="margin-top:14px">
            <div class="feature">
              <h3>Measured design</h3>
              <p>Rituals built for clarity: entry, sound, and reorientation—each portion timed and explained.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
              <h3>Membership focus</h3>
              <p>Regular practice with gentle commitment, tiered access, and member-only assemblies.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
              <h3>Quiet care</h3>
              <p>We pay attention to contraindications and welcome conversation about safety in advance.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="process">
          <div class="step panel">
            <strong>Step 1</strong>
            <p style="margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Set your intent. You can arrive with a single, short phrase to hold through the practice.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step panel">
            <strong>Step 2</strong>
            <p style="margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Enter the room. Guided beginning, extended tone field, and a calm close.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step panel">
            <strong>Step 3</strong>
            <p style="margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Return with a few minutes of journaling or quiet walking to integrate.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="disclaimer">
          <strong>Contraindications & safety</strong>
          <p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Sound immersion is gentle but not always suitable. If you have recent head injury, epilepsy, pregnancy concerns, severe anxiety triggered by sound, or active substance effects, please consult your healthcare provider and contact us before booking.</p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <aside class="panel aside">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Try a short practice</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">A brief guided moment: breath and an intention prompt to feel the pattern of your own attention.</p>
        <button id="openPractice" style="margin-top:12px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:0">Try it now — quick session</button>

        <div style="margin-top:16px;border-radius:8px;padding:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(122,90,60,0.03),transparent)}">
          <strong style="display:block;color:var(--accent)">Contact</strong>
          <div style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Phone: {{PHONE}}<br>Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="max-width:980px;margin:0 auto">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} · For membership enquiries, see the Circle Plans page.</div>
  </footer>

  <div id="practiceModal" class="modal-backdrop" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal" role="document">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Guided minute — breathe & note</h2>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center">
        <div class="pulse" aria-hidden="true"><div class="inner" id="pulseLabel">3</div></div>
        <div style="flex:1">
          <p id="stageText" style="margin:0;color:var(--muted)">When you’re ready, press start. The short sequence will guide 3 rounds of paced breathing then a 90-second journaling prompt.</p>
          <div class="controls">
            <button id="startBtn" style="padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;border:0;background:var(--accent);color:#fff">Start</button>
            <button id="skipBtn" style="padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #ddd;background:#fff">Close</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Practice modal
    const modal = document.getElementById('practiceModal');
    const open = document.getElementById('openPractice');
    const startBtn = document.getElementById('startBtn');
    const skipBtn = document.getElementById('skipBtn');
    const pulseLabel = document.getElementById('pulseLabel');
    const stageText = document.getElementById('stageText');
    let intervalId = null;

    open.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ modal.style.display='flex'; modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false'); });
    skipBtn.addEventListener('click', closeModal);

    function closeModal(){ modal.style.display='none'; modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true'); clearInterval(intervalId); pulseLabel.textContent='3'; stageText.textContent='When you\'re ready, press start. The short sequence will guide 3 rounds of paced breathing then a 90-second journaling prompt.' }

    startBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      let rounds = 3; let step=0; // step cycles: inhale(4s), hold(4s), exhale(6s)
      stageText.textContent='Follow the circle: inhale for 4, hold for 4, exhale for 6. Round 1 of ' + rounds;
      pulseLabel.textContent = rounds;
      const phases = [ {label:'Inhale', secs:4}, {label:'Hold', secs:4}, {label:'Exhale', secs:6} ];
      let phaseIndex=0; let phaseTime=phases[0].secs; let phaseRemaining=phaseTime;

      intervalId = setInterval(()=>{
        // update display
        pulseLabel.textContent = phaseRemaining;
        stageText.textContent = phases[phaseIndex].label + ' — ' + phaseRemaining + 's remaining. Round ' + (step+1) + ' of ' + rounds;
        phaseRemaining--;
        if(phaseRemaining<0){
          phaseIndex++;
          if(phaseIndex>=phases.length){
            phaseIndex=0; step++;
            if(step>=rounds){
              clearInterval(intervalId);
              // journaling prompt
              pulseLabel.textContent='J';
              stageText.textContent='Take 90 seconds to write a sentence or two: What feels different? A short note will help anchor the session.';
              // 90 second countdown
              let t=90; intervalId = setInterval(()=>{
                pulseLabel.textContent = t; t--; if(t<0){ clearInterval(intervalId); pulseLabel.textContent='✓'; stageText.textContent='Done. When you\'re ready, close this window and return slowly.' } },1000);
              return;
            }
          }
          phaseTime = phases[phaseIndex].secs; phaseRemaining = phaseTime;
        }
      },1000);
    });

    // close on backdrop click
    modal.addEventListener('click', function(e){ if(e.target===modal) closeModal(); });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"faq.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Help & FAQ — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fbf8f4;--accent:#6a4b33;--muted:#616161}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;color:#222;background:var(--bg) url('assets/img/pattern.svg') repeat}
    header{padding:18px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(106,75,51,0.06)}
    .nav{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center}
    .nav a{margin-right:10px;color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none}

    main{max-width:980px;margin:26px auto;padding:0 18px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:20px}
    .panel{background:#fff;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(20,16,12,0.03)}
    h1{color:var(--accent);margin:0 0 8px 0}
    .faq-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}
    .faq-item{border-bottom:1px dashed #eee;padding:12px 0}
    .faq-question{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;cursor:pointer}
    .faq-answer{display:none;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;font-size:14px}

    .trybox{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(106,75,51,0.02),transparent)}
    .cta{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}

    .disclaimer{margin-top:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff3f0;border-left:4px solid rgba(106,75,51,0.12);font-size:13px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="nav">
      <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <nav style="margin-left:16px">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="events.html">Gatherings</a>
        <a href="private-sessions.html">Solo Sessions</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Circle Plans</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="faq.html" aria-current="page">Help</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
      <div style="margin-left:auto"><a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="grid">
      <div>
        <div class="panel">
          <h1>Questions people ask</h1>
          <ul class="faq-list" id="faqList">
            <li class="faq-item">
              <div class="faq-question"><strong>What should I bring?</strong><button class="toggleBtn">+</button></div>
              <div class="faq-answer">A mat, blanket, a small cushion for comfort, water, and anything you use to stay warm. Avoid heavy fragrances; you may want a small notebook or pen for integration notes.</div>
            </li>
            <li class="faq-item">
              <div class="faq-question"><strong>How long are gatherings?</strong><button class="toggleBtn">+</button></div>
              <div class="faq-answer">Most group sessions run 60–75 minutes: a brief arrival, a sustained sound field, and a short closing to assist reorientation.</div>
            </li>
            <li class="faq-item">
              <div class="faq-question"><strong>Are sessions suitable for nervousness or insomnia?</strong><button class="toggleBtn">+</button></div>
              <div class="faq-answer">Many people find the practice calming; however, if you have severe panic disorder, trauma that may be triggered by sustained tones, or are undergoing certain kinds of therapy, discuss with us before booking.</div>
            </li>
            <li class="faq-item">
              <div class="faq-question"><strong>Do you accept walk-ins?</strong><button class="toggleBtn">+</button></div>
              <div class="faq-answer">We prioritize members and reservations. If space allows we may accept walk-ins; check the Gatherings page for the next event and capacity.</div>
            </li>
            <li class="faq-item">
              <div class="faq-question"><strong>What is a membership ('Circle')?</strong><button class="toggleBtn">+</button></div>
              <div class="faq-answer">Our Circle plans offer regular access at a reduced rate, priority bookings, and member-only sessions. Visit Circle Plans to see tiers.</div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="panel" style="margin-top:14px">
          <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">On safety</h2>
          <div class="disclaimer">
            Please consult a medical professional if you have epilepsy, recent concussion, are in early pregnancy, or have sound-sensitive conditions. If in doubt, contact us before registering.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="panel trybox">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Mini practice — your attention anchor</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">A brief exercise combining breath and a journaling prompt. Two minutes — for immediate steadiness.</p>
          <button id="startShort" style="margin-top:10px;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:0">Try it now</button>
        </div>

        <div class="panel" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h4 style="margin:0;color:var(--accent)">Need help booking?</h4>
          <p style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Call {{PHONE}} or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a>. We can assist with accessibility requests and contraindication queries.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>
  </main>

  <div id="miniModal" style="display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(10,10,10,0.45);align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px">
    <div style="background:#fff;padding:18px;border-radius:10px;max-width:520px;width:100%">
      <h3 style="margin:0;color:var(--accent)">Two-minute anchor</h3>
      <p id="miniText" style="color:var(--muted)">Press start to begin. Breathe with the prompt, then take a short note.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px">
        <button id="miniStart" style="padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:0">Start</button>
        <button id="miniClose" style="padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #ddd;background:#fff">Close</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // FAQ toggles
    document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item').forEach(item=>{
      const btn = item.querySelector('.toggleBtn'); const ans = item.querySelector('.faq-answer');
      btn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ const open = ans.style.display==='block'; ans.style.display = open ? 'none' : 'block'; btn.textContent = open ? '+' : '−'; });
    });

    // mini practice (shorter guided exercise)
    const miniModal = document.getElementById('miniModal');
    const startShort = document.getElementById('startShort');
    const miniStart = document.getElementById('miniStart');
    const miniClose = document.getElementById('miniClose');
    const miniText = document.getElementById('miniText');
    let miniInterval=null;

    startShort.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ miniModal.style.display='flex'; });
    miniClose.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ miniModal.style.display='none'; clearInterval(miniInterval); miniText.textContent='Press start to begin. Breathe with the prompt, then take a short note.'; });

    miniStart.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      let counts = [4,4,6]; let round=0; miniText.textContent='Round 1 — Inhale 4s / hold 4s / exhale 6s';
      let phase=0; let t = counts[phase]; miniInterval = setInterval(()=>{
        miniText.textContent = (phase===0? 'Inhale ' : phase===1 ? 'Hold ' : 'Exhale ') + t + 's'; t--; if(t<0){ phase++; if(phase>2){ round++; if(round>=1){ clearInterval(miniInterval); miniText.textContent='Write one sentence: How do you feel now?'; return; } else { phase=0; t=counts[phase]; } } else { t=counts[phase]; } } },1000);
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"book.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Reserve — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f4efe8;--accent:#6b4f3a;--seat:#e9d9ca;--selected:#7a5a3c;--muted:#666}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;background:var(--bg) url('assets/img/pattern.svg') repeat;color:#212121}
    header{padding:14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(107,79,58,0.06)}
    .nav{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center}
    .nav a{margin-right:10px;color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none}

    main{max-width:980px;margin:22px auto;padding:0 18px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:18px}
    .panel{background:#fff;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(22,18,15,0.03)}
    h1{color:var(--accent);margin:0 0 8px 0}

    /* seat map */
    .seat-map{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,40px);gap:8px;justify-content:start;margin-top:10px}
    .seat{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--seat);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;border:2px solid transparent}
    .seat.available{background:#e9d9ca;color:#4b3a2b}
    .seat.taken{background:#cfcfcf;color:#fff;cursor:not-allowed}
    .seat.selected{background:var(--selected);color:#fff}

    .controls{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}
    input[type="text"],input[type="email"]{width:100%;padding:9px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #ddd}
    .pack-list{margin-top:12px}
    .pack-list ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)}

    .disclaimer{margin-top:12px;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff3f0;border-left:4px solid rgba(107,79,58,0.12);font-size:13px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="nav">
      <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <nav style="margin-left:16px">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="events.html">Gatherings</a>
        <a href="private-sessions.html">Solo Sessions</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Circle Plans</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="faq.html">Help</a>
        <a href="book.html" aria-current="page">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
      <div style="margin-left:auto"><a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" style="background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="grid">
      <div>
        <div class="panel">
          <h1>Reserve a place</h1>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">Select a date below, choose seats in the map, and generate a packing checklist tailored to your needs.</p>

          <label style="display:block;margin-top:12px">Select event</label>
          <select id="eventSelect" style="padding:9px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #ddd;margin-top:6px">
            <option value="evening-1">Evening Field — Fri • 7:00pm</option>
            <option value="morning-1">Morning Pause — Sat • 9:30am</option>
            <option value="midday-1">Midday Calm — Sun • 12:30pm</option>
          </select>

          <div style="margin-top:14px">
            <strong>Choose seats</strong>
            <div class="seat-map" id="seatMap" aria-label="Seat map">
              <!-- seats generated by JS -->
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
              <div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)">Selected: <span id="selectedCount">0</span></div>
              <div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)">Available: <span id="availableCount">24</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <h3 style="margin:0;color:var(--accent)">Generate your packing list</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Tell us what you prefer and how long you plan to rest, and we’ll suggest items to bring.</p>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
              <select id="duration" style="padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #ddd">
                <option value="60">60 minutes</option>
                <option value="75">75 minutes</option>
                <option value="90">90 minutes</option>
              </select>
              <select id="comfort" style="padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #ddd">
                <option value="standard">Standard comfort</option>
                <option value="cozy">Prefer cozy</option>
                <option value="minimal">Travel / minimal</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:8px">
              <label><input type="checkbox" id="needMat"> I need a mat (reserve one)</label><br>
              <label><input type="checkbox" id="needBlanket"> I will bring a blanket</label>
            </div>

            <div class="controls">
              <button id="genPack" style="padding:9px;border-radius:8px;border:0;background:var(--accent);color:#fff">Create list</button>
